:"drain"},"underDb":24}},"codeShots":true,"why":"A nuclear bunker built the way the account builds things: a deep hole in a yard section, where rain floods it and the walls cave in, then concrete walls, a roof slab, soil and a steel blast door fix it one problem at a time. Each fix opens the next problem: the sealed room goes stale, so an air pipe goes in, and then a blast wave can rush down that pipe, so a valve slams it shut. The camera opens close on the hole, widens to the whole cut, uses number counters beside the soil for the radiation facts, and ends on the calm finished bunker with a ceiling light, bunk beds and grass on top.","hold":true,"beats":[{"s":"hook","shows":{"p":"dig","does":"dig the hole"},"do":[{"p":"dig","v":"dig","o":-0.504}],"shots":[{"focus":["dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"problem","shows":{"p":"holeWater","does":"rain runs into the hole"},"state":{"text":"RAIN IN","w":"rain"},"do":[{"p":"light","v":"storm","w":"But"},{"p":"rain","v":"start","w":"But"},{"p":"lawn","v":"wet","w":"But"},{"p":"puddles","v":"rise","w":"lawn"},{"p":"holeWater","v":"trickle","w":"hole","d":2.4}],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]},{"s":"flood","shows":{"p":"holeWater","does":"water fills the hole"},"do":[{"p":"holeWater","v":"flood","w":"fills"}],"shots":[{"focus":["holeWater","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"stakes","shows":{"p":"crackL","does":"cracks grow, mud caves in"},"do":[{"p":"weight","v":"show","w":"weighs"},{"p":"crackL","v":"grow","w":"crack"},{"p":"crackR","v":"grow","w":"crack","o":0.2},{"p":"cave","v":"fall","w":"cave"}],"shots":[{"focus":["crackL","crackR","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fix1","shows":{"p":"shell","does":"floor and walls grow"},"do":[{"p":"weight","v":"hide","w":"So"},{"p":"cave","v":"hide","w":"drain"},{"p":"holeWater","v":"drain","w":"drain","d":1.6},{"p":"rain","v":"stop","w":"drain"},{"p":"light","v":"clear","w":"drain"},{"p":"lawn","v":"dry","w":"drain"},{"p":"puddles","v":"dry","w":"drain","d":2},{"p":"shell","v":"grow","w":"floor","ch":"floor"},{"p":"shell","v":"grow","w":"walls","ch":"wallL"},{"p":"shell","v":"grow","w":"walls","o":0.15,"ch":"wallR"},{"p":"shell","v":"grow","w":"walls","o":0.4,"ch":"back"}],"shots":[{"focus":["shell","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fix2","shows":{"p":"roof","does":"roof slab grows, soil piles on"},"do":[{"p":"roof","v":"grow","w":"roof","d":1,"ch":"roof"},{"p":"soilCap","v":"grow","w":"soil","d":1.2}],"shots":[{"focus":["roof","soilCap","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fix3","shows":{"p":"blastDoor","does":"steel door appears, wheel turns"},"do":[{"p":"blastDoor","v":"show","w":"door"},{"p":"blastDoor","v":"turn","w":"door","o":0.8}],"shots":[{"focus":["blastDoor","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"name","shows":{"p":"outline","does":"glowing outline round the bunker"},"do":[{"p":"blastDoor","v":"turnBack","w":"This"},{"p":"outline","v":"show","w":"nuclear"}],"shots":[{"hero":true,"focus":["shell","roof","outline","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"how","shows":{"p":"rays","does":"radiation and blast arrows hit the soil and roof"},"do":[{"p":"outline","v":"hide","w":"Soil"},{"p":"rays","v":"show","w":"radiation"},{"p":"shock","v":"show","w":"blast"}],"shots":[{"focus":["roof","rays","shock","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fact","shows":{"p":"dose","does":"dose counter falls from 1000 to 1 beside the soil"},"do":[{"p":"rays","v":"hide","w":"Three"},{"p":"shock","v":"hide","w":"Three"},{"p":"boxR","v":"show","w":"Three"},{"p":"dose","v":"show","w":"Three","o":0.3},{"p":"dose","v":"count","w":"cuts","d":2.2}],"shots":[{"focus":["dose","soilCap","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"problem2","shows":{"p":"stale","does":"stale air bubbles fill the room"},"state":{"text":"STALE AIR","w":"stale"},"do":[{"p":"dose","v":"hide","w":"But"},{"p":"stale","v":"show","w":"stale"}],"shots":[{"focus":["shell","stale","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fix4","shows":{"p":"filter","does":"fan spins and air runs down the pipe"},"do":[{"p":"filter","v":"show","w":"filter"},{"p":"filter","v":"spin","w":"fan"},{"p":"stale","v":"hide","w":"fresh"},{"p":"filter","v":"air","w":"pipe"}],"shots":[{"focus":["filter","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"problem3","shows":{"p":"ventBlast","does":"blast arrows rush down the vent pipe"},"state":{"text":"BLAST IN","w":"hole"},"do":[{"p":"ventBlast","v":"show","w":"blast"}],"shots":[{"focus":["ventBlast","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"fix5","shows":{"p":"filter","does":"valve appears and its lever slams shut"},"do":[{"p":"filter","v":"addValve","w":"valve"},{"p":"filter","v":"slam","w":"slams"},{"p":"ventBlast","v":"hide","w":"shut"}],"shots":[{"focus":["filter","dig"],"width":0.68}]},{"s":"finish","shows":{"p":"grassCap","does":"ceiling light, bunk beds, grass cap"},"do":[{"p":"decay","v":"show"},{"p":"decay","v":"count","d":2.5},{"p":"decay","v":"hide","w":"Add"},{"p":"lamp","v":"show","w":"light"},{"p":"bunk","v":"show","w":"bunk"},{"p":"grassCap","v":"grow","w":"grass","o":-0.7,"d":0.9}],"shots":[{"focus":["dig","lamp","bunk","grassCap"],"width":0.85}]},{"s":"congrats","do":[],"shots":[{"focus":"home"}]}],"roles":["hook","problem","flood","stakes","fix1","fix2","fix3","name","how","fact","problem2","fix4","problem3","fix5","finish","congrats"]},"sentences":[{"role":"hook","text":"If you dig a deep hole in your yard, you have a bunker."},{"role":"problem","text":"But the first storm soaks the lawn and the rain pours straight into the hole."},{"role":"flood","text":"Water fills the hole to the brim like a bathtub."},{"role":"stakes","text":"Wet soil weighs roughly 100 to 130 pounds per cubic foot, so the walls crack and cave in."},{"role":"fix1","text":"So you drain it, pour a concrete floor and walls to hold the soil back."},{"role":"fix2","text":"Next you cap the box with a thick roof and pile three feet of soil on top."},{"role":"fix3","text":"Then you hang a steel door on the only way in, and the biggest ones weigh 25 tons."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a nuclear bunker."},{"role":"how","text":"Soil and concrete soak up the radiation, while the door and roof stop the blast wave."},{"role":"fact","text":"Three feet of packed soil cuts gamma rays by a factor of about 1000."},{"role":"problem2","text":"But now the concrete box is sealed in, so the people keep breathing and the air goes stale."},{"role":"fix4","text":"So you add a filter and a fan that pull fresh air down a pipe from outside."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But the pipe you added is a hole in the shield, and a blast wave would rush straight down it."},{"role":"fix5","text":"So you add a blast valve on the pipe that slams shut when the shock arrives."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a ceiling light, bunk beds, and the grass back on top."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a nuclear bunker."}]}